            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is [by design](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a118a964c94543c06d8b1f2f7542535dd2e19d36/doc/mini-ai.txt#L175-L179) and is more oriented towards the following type of use cases: remove `bbb_` from `aaa_bbb_ccc` while preserving snake case.\r\n\r\nTo avoid this, define custom textobjects for surrounding characters you use, like `*`, `/`, etc.",
